{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, manage and run the ultimate Tabletop Game Shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, design the layout, and create the perfect atmosphere. Stack the shelves with miniatures, rulebooks, paints, mystery packs, and gaming accessories, adapting to\u00a0 customer demands and market trends. Hire and train employees to handle the cash register, restock shelves, or even paint and assemble miniatures.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/940c83ae70bf7b35240a41ee5390d533.poster.avif?t=1756905342\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/940c83ae70bf7b35240a41ee5390d533.webm?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/940c83ae70bf7b35240a41ee5390d533.mp4?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Collect, Assemble &amp; Paint Miniature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a manager, you\u2019re also a collector! Open mystery packs to discover rare miniature parts, then assemble and paint them to increase their value. Sell them for profit or keep them for your personal collection. Create stunning, one-of-a-kind figures that will impress your customers and boost your shop\u2019s reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/ecaf2a1ecd165f932969e7dbd6fa89a9.poster.avif?t=1756905342\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/ecaf2a1ecd165f932969e7dbd6fa89a9.webm?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/ecaf2a1ecd165f932969e7dbd6fa89a9.mp4?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play Against Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize tournaments and one-on-one battles against customers, proving your skills with your own miniature collection on the line. Use your best miniatures and strategies to dominate the battlefield, earning rewards and boosting your shop\u2019s prestige.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/170501d2a07ce6b555898dde6c8bf85b.poster.avif?t=1756905342\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/170501d2a07ce6b555898dde6c8bf85b.webm?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/170501d2a07ce6b555898dde6c8bf85b.mp4?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use climbing profits to host bigger events, acquire more product licences, and attract high-profile customers. Host special game nights, launch exclusive figure collections, and turn your store into the heart of the tabletop gaming community!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/c43678703e7124913c61882d124d40a6.poster.avif?t=1756905342\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/c43678703e7124913c61882d124d40a6.webm?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/c43678703e7124913c61882d124d40a6.mp4?t=1756905342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to roll the dice and build your dream store in Tabletop Game Shop Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524750?t=1756905342","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/fbfc70ac83548ddeed60ccc99ee9aaed63c3e9c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756905342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/6a5ba53c9613f63903834fc9ee16923429f59064/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756905342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/6a5ba53c9613f63903834fc9ee16923429f59064/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756905342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3919260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, manage and run the ultimate Tabletop Game Shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, design the layout, and create the perfect atmosphere. Stack the shelves with miniatures, rulebooks, paints, mystery packs, and gaming accessories, adapting to\u00a0 customer demands and market trends. Hire and train employees to handle the cash register, restock shelves, or even paint and assemble miniatures.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla